<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>لا يمكنك الدخول — FX9 Dashboard</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="denied-page">
    <div class="denied-box glass fade-in-up">
      <div class="denied-icon-wrapper">
        <div class="denied-lock-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-user-lock"></i>
        </div>
      </div>
      <% const reason = locals.reason || 'owner' %>
      <% if (reason === 'guild') { %>
        <div class="denied-status-badge">صلاحية محدودة</div>
        <h1>ليس لديك صلاحية لهذا السيرفر</h1>
        <p class="denied-subtitle">هذا السيرفر يتطلب صلاحية "إدارة السيرفر" أو أن تكون مشرفاً مضافاً في لوحة تحكم البوت</p>
        <div class="denied-features">
          <div class="denied-feature">
            <div class="denied-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-user-shield"></i></div>
            <div class="denied-feature-text">
              <strong>صلاحية إدارة السيرفر</strong>
              <span>يجب أن تمتلك صلاحية "Manage Guild" في هذا السيرفر على ديسكورد</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="denied-feature">
            <div class="denied-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-users-cog"></i></div>
            <div class="denied-feature-text">
              <strong>مشرف في البوت</strong>
              <span>إذا كنت مضافاً كمدير في البوت، يمكنك الوصول إلى السيرفرات المخصصة لك</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="denied-feature">
            <div class="denied-feature-icon"><i class="fab fa-discord"></i></div>
            <div class="denied-feature-text">
              <strong>تحتاج مساعدة؟</strong>
              <span>تواصل مع مالك البوت لإضافة صلاحياتك أو راجع سيرفر الدعم الفني</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="denied-divider"></div>
        <div class="denied-actions">
          <a href="/guilds" class="denied-btn denied-btn-primary">
            <i class="fas fa-server"></i>
            العودة إلى السيرفرات
          </a>
          <a href="/" class="denied-btn denied-btn-secondary">
            <i class="fas fa-home"></i>
            الصفحة الرئيسية
          </a>
          <a href="/auth/logout" class="denied-btn denied-btn-outline">
            <i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i>
            تسجيل الخروج
          </a>
        </div>
      <% } else { %>
        <div class="denied-status-badge">صلاحية محدودة</div>
        <h1>لا يمكنك الوصول إلى هنا</h1>
        <p class="denied-subtitle">هذه الصفحة تتطلب صلاحيات خاصة — حسابك الحالي لا يمتلك التصريح اللازم للدخول إليها</p>
        <div class="denied-features">
          <div class="denied-feature">
            <div class="denied-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div>
            <div class="denied-feature-text">
              <strong>صلاحيات غير كافية</strong>
              <span>أنت بحاجة إلى دور مالك البوت أو مطور للوصول إلى هذه اللوحة</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="denied-feature">
            <div class="denied-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-th-large"></i></div>
            <div class="denied-feature-text">
              <strong>لوحة التحكم</strong>
              <span>إذا كنت مشرف سيرفر، يمكنك إدارة البوت من خلال لوحة التحكم الرئيسية</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="denied-feature">
            <div class="denied-feature-icon"><i class="fab fa-discord"></i></div>
            <div class="denied-feature-text">
              <strong>تحتاج مساعدة؟</strong>
              <span>تواصل معنا عبر سيرفر الدعم الفني وسنكون سعداء بمساعدتك</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="denied-divider"></div>
        <div class="denied-actions">
          <a href="/dashboard" class="denied-btn denied-btn-primary">
            <i class="fas fa-th-large"></i>
            العودة إلى لوحة التحكم
          </a>
          <a href="https://discord.gg/ENQut4HHKb" class="denied-btn denied-btn-secondary" target="_blank">
            <i class="fab fa-discord"></i>
            سيرفر الدعم الفني
          </a>
          <a href="/auth/logout" class="denied-btn denied-btn-outline">
            <i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i>
            تسجيل الخروج
          </a>
        </div>
      <% } %>
      <div class="denied-footer">
        <p>FX9 Dashboard &copy; 2026 — جميع الحقوق محفوظة</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0f1a 0%, #1a1a2e 50%, #0f0f1a 100%);
      direction: rtl;
      font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
    }
    .denied-page {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .denied-box {
      padding: 44px 28px 32px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 20px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .denied-box::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -60px;
      left: -60px;
      width: 140px;
      height: 140px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(237,66,69,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .denied-box::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -80px;
      right: -80px;
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(237,66,69,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .denied-icon-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
    }
    .denied-lock-icon {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(237,66,69,0.2), rgba(237,66,69,0.05));
      border: 2px solid rgba(237,66,69,0.3);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #ed4245;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .denied-icon-wrapper::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -8px; left: -8px; right: -8px; bottom: -8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(237,66,69,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
      animation: deniedPulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes deniedPulse {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.6; }
      50% { transform: scale(1.25); opacity: 0; }
    }
    .denied-status-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 5px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      background: rgba(237,66,69,0.12);
      color: #ed4245;
      border: 1px solid rgba(237,66,69,0.2);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .denied-box h1 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text, #eee);
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }
    .denied-subtitle {
      margin: 0 0 28px;
      color: var(--text-secondary, #999);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 320px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
    .denied-features {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .denied-feature {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.025);
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      text-align: right;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .denied-feature:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    }
    .denied-feature-icon {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: rgba(88,101,242,0.12);
      color: #5865f2;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }
    .denied-feature-text {
      flex: 1;
    }
    .denied-feature-text strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text, #ddd);
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }
    .denied-feature-text span {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-muted, #777);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .denied-divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(to left, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.08), transparent);
      margin: 24px 0 20px;
    }
    .denied-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .denied-btn {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .denied-btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5865f2, #4752c4);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(88,101,242,0.25);
    }
    .denied-btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(88,101,242,0.35);
    }
    .denied-btn-primary:active {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    .denied-btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      color: var(--text, #ddd);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    }
    .denied-btn-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }
    .denied-btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: #ed4245;
      border: 1px solid rgba(237,66,69,0.3);
    }
    .denied-btn-outline:hover {
      background: rgba(237,66,69,0.08);
      border-color: rgba(237,66,69,0.5);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }
    .denied-footer {
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
    .denied-footer p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--text-muted, #555);
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .fade-in-up {
      animation: deniedFadeInUp 0.6s ease forwards;
    }
    @keyframes deniedFadeInUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  </style>
</body>
</html>